  "details": "Whenever you upload a banner, it doesn't display it very well, it works for Desktop users, but it doesn't work for VR (PCVR & Quest) users, even when using this custom PSD with specific dimensions (https://www.reddit.com/comments/10e11hb/)\n\nThe same way, some images that work with VR users don't work with Desktop users\n\nNote: The pictures look good in all platforms when opening the Launch Pad, but they don't look good in specific platforms depending on the dimensions used when not on the Launch Pad.\n\nNote for attachments: the first 4 screenshots are from Desktop POV, the last 4 screenshots are from PCVR POV (couldn't get Quest POV unfortunately). The \"Good Boy\" and \"Good Girl\" both use the same dimensions, while the \"Chocoholic\" one uses the dimensions recommended from the PSD I linked.",
